+"""Finite passive XLSX/ODS richness projection for an independent scalar gate.
+
+The ORIGINAL bytes pass Package/Spreadsheet before any projection. Only fully
+captured structures are removed, in memory, for the real scalar parser. This is
+not a converter, repairer, Office executor, or destination reconstruction path.
+Unmodelled features remain for that parser to reject, or are refused here.
+"""
